## PLAIN ENGLISH
22.8 GB at ~02:00 was real. 39 MB at 02:14 was a different ELF, not a close of
that path. Live board residual after B8 is **28 s / 12 GB**, not 39 MB.

Product `ooda/std` has **38** `.oo` files on disk, not 34 (F20) and not 36
(SPRINT wave note: sh + scenario only). Line counts drifted. Three files match
the old F20 table (byte, python, test).

`ooda/std/os/env.oo` forwards to `oo_env_get`. It does not recurse.

`.oo` smokes for F20 / F26 / p7 still exist. Their **invariants are still
written**. Several F20 numbers are stale and would fail on this tree.

